  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H1FWHVPSIB-17
TITLE: Serial Bootloader Interface
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware implements a serial bootloader interface using the UART3 peripheral to allow
firmware updates via a serial protocol. The serial interface supports the MCUboot management
group commands for updating application images over a serial link.

The serial bootloader supports the following operations:
- Image upload and verification
- Image validation status reporting
- Erase of application flash memory
- Programming of application flash memory

The serial interface operates in interrupt-driven mode for both transmission and reception to
provide non-blocking operation with the application validation and jump procedures.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H1FWHVPSIB-4
  ROLE: Refines

